<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves rise FIM 213 mln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves rise FIM 213 mln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet to February 21 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to February 14:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 61,885	 61,673</p>
<p> Money market intervention    14,823	 14,823</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,907	  1,907</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,262	  2,263</p>
<p> Total assets		     87,998	 87,607</p>
<p>In the previous week to Februay 14, reserves fell by 192 million markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
